{% macro help(en, zh='') -%}
<span class="help">?<span class="tip"><span class="l-en">{{ en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ zh if zh else en }}</span></span></span>
{%- endmacro %}
{% macro t(en, zh='') -%}
<span class="l-en">{{ en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ zh if zh else en }}</span>
{%- endmacro %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ t('ETF flow radar — what funds are accumulating', 'ETF 资金雷达 — 基金在增持什么') }}</title>
<script>try{var th=localStorage.getItem('theme');if(th)document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',th);var l=localStorage.getItem('lang');if(l)document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-lang',l);}catch(e){}</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="theme.css">
<style>
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  body { background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font:14px/1.5 -apple-system,
         "Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,sans-serif; margin:0; padding:18px; }
  @media (min-width:1100px){ body{ padding:26px max(40px,calc((100vw - 1200px)/2)); } }
  a { text-decoration:none; }
  h1 { font-size:20px; margin:0; }
  h2 { font-size:14px; margin:0 0 10px; color:var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase;
       letter-spacing:.06em; }
  .panel { background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px;
           padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .topline { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:12px; }
  .muted { color:var(--muted); }
  .state { display:inline-block; padding:2px 11px; border-radius:12px; font-weight:700;
           font-size:12.5px; }
  table { border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:13px; }
  th,td { text-align:left; padding:5px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  th { color:var(--muted); font-weight:500; }
  td.r, th.r { text-align:right; }
  .pos { color:var(--up); } .neg { color:var(--down); }
  .tag { display:inline-block; padding:1px 8px; border-radius:8px; font-size:11px;
         font-weight:600; }
  .tag-active { background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--info) 15%,var(--panel));
                color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--info) 80%,var(--text)); }
  .tag-passive { background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--muted) 15%,var(--panel));
                 color:var(--muted); }
  .help { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:15px;
          height:15px; border-radius:50%; border:1px solid var(--muted); color:var(--muted);
          font-size:10px; font-weight:600; cursor:help; position:relative;
          vertical-align:middle; margin-left:5px; }
  .help .tip { display:none; position:absolute; top:140%; left:50%;
               transform:translateX(-50%); width:320px; background:var(--panel);
               border:1px solid var(--line); padding:9px 11px; border-radius:8px; z-index:60;
               font-size:12px; line-height:1.45; color:var(--text); font-weight:400;
               box-shadow:var(--popover-shadow); pointer-events:none; }
  .help:hover .tip { display:block; }
  .navbtn, .lang-btn, .theme-btn { font-size:12.5px; padding:5px 11px; border-radius:8px;
    border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--panel2); color:var(--text); cursor:pointer; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="topline">
      <h1>🐳 {{ t('ETF flow radar', 'ETF 资金雷达') }}</h1>
      <span class="muted">{{ t('what funds are accumulating & trimming', '基金在增持与减持什么') }}</span>
      <span style="flex:1"></span>
      <a class="navbtn" href="macro.html">{{ t('← Dashboard', '← 仪表盘') }}</a>
      <a class="navbtn" href="stock.html">{{ t('🔎 Any stock', '🔎 任意股票') }}</a>
      <button class="lang-btn">中文</button>
      <button class="theme-btn">☀️ {{ t('Light', '浅色') }}</button>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 0">{{ t(
      "For each tracked ETF we diff its daily holdings and strip out mechanical creation/redemption flow, leaving the fund's actual SHARE decision per position (flow-normalized). A big positive number = the fund added to a name beyond what fund in/outflows explain.",
      "对每只跟踪的 ETF，我们比对其每日持仓并剔除机械性的申购／赎回资金流，留下基金对每个仓位的真实“份额决策”（已按资金流标准化）。较大的正值=基金在该股上的增持超过了资金进出所能解释的部分。") }}
      {{ help("Two honest readings: on ACTIVELY managed funds (ARK etc.) a large active share change is genuine manager conviction. On PASSIVE index/sector funds (SPDR, iShares) there is no discretionary manager — the change is index reconstitution / float-weight rebalancing (forced index-fund buying). Both are real institutional flow; the tag tells you which. Where a holding has its own price history, its cycle state is shown (✅ = accumulation that also has a forming buy setup). Thresholds are uncalibrated and signals need ≥2 daily snapshots to appear.",
      "两种诚实的解读：在主动管理基金（如 ARK）上，较大的主动份额变动是真实的经理人信念。在被动指数／板块基金（SPDR、iShares）上没有主动经理——变动来自指数再平衡／流通权重调整（被动强制买入）。两者都是真实的机构资金流；标签会告诉你属于哪种。若某持仓有自身价格历史，会显示其周期状态（✅=增持同时出现正在形成的买入形态）。阈值尚未校准，且信号需要≥2个每日快照才会出现。") }}
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2>{{ t('Biggest fund share decisions', '基金最大份额决策') }}</h2>
    {% if etf_rows %}
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th class="l">{{ t('ETF', '基金') }}</th>
        <th class="l">{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('weight', '权重') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('active chg', '主动变动') }}</th>
        <th class="l">{{ t('signal', '信号') }}</th>
        <th class="l">{{ t('technical', '技术面') }}</th>
        <th class="l">{{ t('window', '窗口') }}</th>
      </tr>
      {% for r in etf_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l"><b>{{ r.etf }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ r.etf_name }}{% if r.category %} · {{ td(r.category) }}{% endif %}</span></td>
        <td class="l"><a href="stock.html#{{ r.ticker }}"><b>{{ r.ticker }}</b></a> <span class="muted">{{ r.name }}</span></td>
        <td class="r muted">{% if r.weight_pct is not none %}{{ "%.2f" | format(r.weight_pct) }}%{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="r {{ 'pos' if r.active_chg_pct >= 0 else 'neg' }}"><b>{{ "%+.0f" | format(r.active_chg_pct) }}%</b></td>
        <td class="l">{% if r.is_active %}<span class="tag tag-active">{{ t('manager conviction', '经理人信念') }}</span>{% else %}<span class="tag tag-passive">{{ t('index / rebalance flow', '指数／再平衡资金流') }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="l">{% if r.ladder %}<span class="state st-{{ r.ladder.state | replace(' ', '_') }}">{{ td(r.ladder.label) }}</span>{% if r.confirmed %} ✅{% endif %}{% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}{% if r.vol and r.vol.surging %} <span title="volume {{ r.vol.ratio }}× recent avg">📊</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="l muted">{{ r.window }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <p class="muted">{{ t('Building — the collector writes one full-holdings snapshot per ETF per day; flow-normalized decisions appear once each fund has at least two snapshots. Coverage grows as the universe in config.yml is expanded toward the top ~200.', '构建中 — 采集器每天为每只 ETF 写入一份完整持仓快照；当每只基金至少有两个快照后，按资金流标准化的决策即会显示。随着 config.yml 中的范围扩展至前约 200 只，覆盖面会增加。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:0">{{ t(
      "Coverage: SPDR / State Street, ARK, Invesco and Global X are verified daily holdings feeds (with shares). iShares and Schwab are blocked by anti-bot / consent walls, and Vanguard publishes no free daily feed, so those funds are absent — not a daily signal we can source cleanly. A fund missing here failed today's fetch and is skipped, never crashing the page. See LIMITATIONS.md.",
      "覆盖范围：SPDR／道富、ARK、Invesco 与 Global X 为已验证的每日持仓数据（含份额）。iShares 与嘉信因反爬／同意墙被屏蔽，Vanguard 无免费每日数据，故这些基金缺失——无法干净地作为每日信号获取。此处缺失的基金为今日抓取失败并被跳过，绝不会使页面崩溃。详见 LIMITATIONS.md。") }}
      {{ t('Generated', '生成于') }} {{ generated_utc }} UTC</p>
  </div>

<script src="theme.js"></script>
<footer class="site-footer">
  <span class="made">Made with ❤️ in Canada</span>
  <span class="dev">Developed by Chris Wong</span>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
